01:08:34.279 --> 01:08:36.080
do the best they can as a volunteer.

01:08:36.080 --> 01:08:39.319
And it's a huge task if you've never organised or don't

01:08:39.319 --> 01:08:42.760
organise comps very often. And that's where the pilot just

01:08:42.760 --> 01:08:46.479
has to respect that really and try and stay within the

01:08:46.479 --> 01:08:47.800
boundaries of what we're trying to do, I mean.

01:08:48.399 --> 01:08:52.080
What I was going to say is that is it all worth it even though

01:08:52.080 --> 01:08:54.560
you are like fairly well organised and professional

01:08:54.560 --> 01:08:57.200
