01:09:30.920 --> 01:09:35.920
repeated races year after year. We take on a lot of risk in

01:09:35.920 --> 01:09:38.800
liability potentially. So that has to be managed.

01:09:40.680 --> 01:09:43.399
We're we're good at putting out forms.

01:09:43.399 --> 01:09:48.080
You must sign disclaimers and stuff or whatever validity they

